    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Unlike many agencies that add hidden fees on the day you actually move, reputable packers in Shahjahanpur commit to a single, all‑inclusive rate. The quoted price covers every step of the process – packing, loading, transport, unloading, and even re‑assembly of furniture. No surprise “last‑minute” charges.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Itemized Written Contracts:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Before any boxes are sealed, you receive a detailed written agreement. Each category of goods – fragile items, heavy furniture, electronics, and specialty equipment – is listed with its own unit cost and any additional handling fees. This contract protects you from mis‑billing and gives you a clear audit trail.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Bills for Government/Corporate Claims:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For clients with governmental or corporate responsibilities, the International Baggage Association (IBA) standards apply. The moving company issues IBA‑approved invoices that meet the strict documentation required for reimbursement or tax deduction. These bills include line items, dates, and service codes that align with government procurement guidelines.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">100% Declared‑Value Transit Insurance:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by a transit insurance policy that matches the full declared value of your goods. Whether it’s a small apartment move or a large commercial relocation, you can rest assured that the insurer will reimburse 100% of the loss value in the event of damage or theft, without any deductibles.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In practice, a typical move in Shahjahanpur might look like this: you book online and receive an initial estimate. After a site visit, the company sends a signed contract that lists all items and associated costs. On the day of the move, the crew follows the contract’s schedule, loading the truck in a documented sequence.</p>
<p>Throughout the journey, GPS and video logs provide real‑time proof of transit. Upon arrival, you verify the delivery against the contract, sign off on the final bill, and receive the IBA‑approved invoice. Finally, the insurance policy is activated, giving you peace of mind that your belongings are protected from start to finish.</p>

<p>Choosing a firm that adheres to these transparent pricing practices ensures you pay exactly what you agreed to, with no hidden fees, and receive full protection for your assets throughout the move.</p></div>
