  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Video Call Survey</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The client can share photos and videos of their belongings, and a surveyor from the company will provide an estimate based on that.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	<p>During the survey, the team will document the number of rooms, the type of furniture and appliances, and any special items that require extra care. This information will be used to determine the cost and the type of packing materials required.</p>

	<p>Once the survey is completed, the packers and movers company will start the packing process. The workflow for packing is as follows:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> The kitchen items are packed first to ensure they are ready before the loading process.</li>
		<li><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Furniture items like beds, wardrobes, and other furniture are packed in the bedrooms.</li>
		<li><strong>Living Room:</strong> Electronics, decorative items, and other delicate items are packed in the living room.</li>
		<li><strong>Office:</strong> If the client has an office, the team will pack files, documents, and office equipment.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Each item is carefully wrapped, labeled, and packed in strong cartons using quality packing materials such as bubble wrap, moving blankets, and tape. The team ensures that fragile items are handled with utmost care.</p>

	<p>After packing is complete, the items are loaded onto transportation vehicles. The packers and movers company ensures that:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Furniture is secured with proper padding and straps to prevent movement during transit.</li>
		<li>Electronics and fragile items are placed in the center of the truck to avoid contact with hard surfaces.</li>
		<li>A label roster is maintained to track each carton's location and ensure everything is loaded and unloaded in the correct order.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>The vehicles are driven by experienced drivers who are familiar with local traffic and routes in Shahjahanpur.</p>
